In my PR we noticed that we would need a small API change:

``` diff
namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Routing;

public interface IHttpMethodMetadata
{
-    bool AcceptCorsPreflight { get; }
+    bool AcceptCorsPreflight { get => throw;  set => throw; }
}

public sealed class HttpMethodMetadata : IHttpMethodMetadata
{
-    public bool AcceptCorsPreflight { get; }
+    public bool AcceptCorsPreflight { get; set; }
}
```

### Alternative design:

``` diff
namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Routing;

public interface IHttpMethodMetadata
{
-    bool AcceptCorsPreflight { get; }
+    bool AcceptCorsPreflight { get => false;  throw; }
}

public sealed class HttpMethodMetadata : IHttpMethodMetadata
{
-    public bool AcceptCorsPreflight { get; }
+    public bool AcceptCorsPreflight { get; set; }
}
```

API Review Notes:

- We'd prefer leaving the getter unimplemented if possible, but it's not.
- Adding a default getter that returns false seems like the best alternative.

API Approved!

``` diff
namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Routing;

public interface IHttpMethodMetadata
{
-    bool AcceptCorsPreflight { get; }
+    bool AcceptCorsPreflight { get => false; set => throw new NotImplementedException(); }
}

public sealed class HttpMethodMetadata : IHttpMethodMetadata
{
-    public bool AcceptCorsPreflight { get; }
+    public bool AcceptCorsPreflight { get; set; }
}
```
